{
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "name": "Edit, clip and dub videos from a Telegram chat with Renderster and OpenAI",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "365e8ffa-3f47-5846-835b-ad892765d6c1",
      "name": "About this template",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1100,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 600,
        "height": 940,
        "content": "## Edit, clip and dub videos from a Telegram chat\n\nSend your bot a video or a link with a few words, and get it back edited, cut into clips, dubbed or transcribed.\n\n### Who's it for\nCreators, coaches and small teams who record on their phone and want a finished video without opening an editor, and agencies giving clients a simple bot.\n\n### How it works\n1. The bot receives a message; only the chat IDs listed in **Settings** may use it.\n2. OpenAI reads the request in any language, as plain words or commands: `/auto hardcopy`, `/auto hyper`, `/clips 3`, `/dub es`, `/transcript`.\n3. The video file (up to 20 MB) or the link goes to Renderster: auto edit in four styles (including the dark cinematic **hardcopy**), clips with captions, dubbing into 16 languages, or a transcript.\n4. Renderster calls the workflow back when the job is done. The bot sends the videos (or links to the big ones) and logs the job in Google Sheets.\n5. Errors are explained in the chat; failed jobs give their credits back.\n\n### Setup\n1. Get a Renderster API key at [renderster.com](https://renderster.com/?utm_source=n8n&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=telegram-video-editor-bot) and add a **Header Auth** credential: name `X-API-Key`, value your key.\n2. Create a bot with @BotFather and add the Telegram credential.\n3. Add an OpenAI credential and pick a sheet with the columns of **Log the job**.\n4. Activate the workflow and message the bot: it answers with your chat ID. Put it in **allowed_chat_ids** in **Settings**.\n\n### Requirements\nRenderster (auto edit and dub need a paid plan, with a 7-day free trial), a Telegram bot, OpenAI (gpt-4o-mini) and Google Sheets.\n\n### Customization\nChange the defaults (style, clip count, dub language, captions, music) in **Settings**, or teach new commands in **Understand the request**."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
